OL,4,BToo late for Jackson? - FPL gameweek   
OL,5,B11 dilemmas                            
OL,6,GThe Premier League is back after the   
OL,7,Ginternational break and BBC Sport's    
OL,8,GFantasy Premier League expert Gianni   
OL,9,GButtice gives his answers to some of   
OL,10,Gthe biggest dilemmas facing managers   
OL,11,Gheading into gameweek 11.              
OL,13,FWith 33 points in the past three       
OL,14,Frounds, you might think you've missed  
OL,15,Fyour chance to own Aston Villa forward 
OL,16,FNicholas Jackson (#7.2m). But he       
OL,17,Fremains in superb form, with five      
OL,18,Fexcellent fixtures ahead, making him   
OL,19,Fthe round's most transferred player    
OL,20,Fonce again.                            
